  "body": "Selling/listed on behalf of owners.\r\n\r\nThis wonderful Sensation built home, was constructed by us in 2013.\r\nLocated in one of the earliest and most desirable parts of 'Seaview Stage 4', Millwater.\r\n\r\n4 double bedrooms - 208sqm floor area\r\n2 car garaging - heaps of room out the front of section if you want extra parking for more cars/boat etc.\r\nCompletely flat & private section with no banks or properties overlooking - 541sqm\r\nRoom for a pool\r\nCentrally located, with easy access to shops, schools, parks and reserves.\r\n\r\nVacant possession - home is staged.\r\n\r\nPlease phone to view, or call in at open home times.\r\nFeel free to ask any questions.",
